{"years":{"list":["2026-27","2027-28"]},"pages":{"about":{"placeholder":false,"content":"<p>Rotary&nbsp;International&nbsp;District&nbsp;3141&nbsp;is&nbsp;part&nbsp;of&nbsp;Rotary&nbsp;Zone&nbsp;4.&nbsp;The&nbsp;district&nbsp;serves&nbsp;Greater&nbsp;Mumbai&nbsp;and&nbsp;Mulund&nbsp;across&nbsp;Maharashtra.&nbsp;Its&nbsp;Rotary&nbsp;clubs&nbsp;are&nbsp;complemented&nbsp;by&nbsp;Rotaract&nbsp;and&nbsp;Interact&nbsp;clubs,&nbsp;which&nbsp;extend&nbsp;Rotary&#39;s&nbsp;leadership&nbsp;and&nbsp;service&nbsp;opportunities&nbsp;to&nbsp;young&nbsp;professionals,&nbsp;university&nbsp;students,&nbsp;and&nbsp;secondary&nbsp;school&nbsp;students&nbsp;across&nbsp;the&nbsp;district.&nbsp;Like&nbsp;every&nbsp;Rotary&nbsp;district,&nbsp;District&nbsp;3141&nbsp;is&nbsp;led&nbsp;each&nbsp;Rotary&nbsp;year,&nbsp;which&nbsp;runs&nbsp;from&nbsp;1&nbsp;July&nbsp;to&nbsp;30&nbsp;June,&nbsp;by&nbsp;a&nbsp;District&nbsp;Governor&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;team&nbsp;of&nbsp;volunteer&nbsp;Rotarians&nbsp;who&nbsp;coordinate&nbsp;the&nbsp;work&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;individual&nbsp;clubs,&nbsp;support&nbsp;new&nbsp;club&nbsp;development,&nbsp;and&nbsp;represent&nbsp;the&nbsp;district&nbsp;within&nbsp;Rotary&nbsp;Zone&nbsp;4&nbsp;and&nbsp;Rotary&nbsp;International&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;whole.</p><p></p><p>Rotary&nbsp;clubs&nbsp;in&nbsp;District&nbsp;3141&nbsp;organize&nbsp;their&nbsp;work&nbsp;through&nbsp;the&nbsp;five&nbsp;Avenues&nbsp;of&nbsp;Service&nbsp;that&nbsp;guide&nbsp;every&nbsp;Rotary&nbsp;club&nbsp;worldwide.&nbsp;Club&nbsp;Service&nbsp;focuses&nbsp;on&nbsp;strengthening&nbsp;fellowship&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;effective&nbsp;functioning&nbsp;of&nbsp;each&nbsp;club.&nbsp;Vocational&nbsp;Service&nbsp;encourages&nbsp;members&nbsp;to&nbsp;serve&nbsp;others&nbsp;through&nbsp;their&nbsp;own&nbsp;professions&nbsp;and&nbsp;to&nbsp;practice&nbsp;high&nbsp;ethical&nbsp;standards&nbsp;in&nbsp;business&nbsp;and&nbsp;community&nbsp;life.&nbsp;Community&nbsp;Service&nbsp;covers&nbsp;the&nbsp;local&nbsp;projects&nbsp;and&nbsp;activities&nbsp;that&nbsp;clubs&nbsp;undertake&nbsp;to&nbsp;improve&nbsp;everyday&nbsp;life&nbsp;in&nbsp;their&nbsp;towns&nbsp;and&nbsp;cities.&nbsp;International&nbsp;Service&nbsp;extends&nbsp;humanitarian&nbsp;projects&nbsp;and&nbsp;goodwill&nbsp;beyond&nbsp;the&nbsp;district&#39;s&nbsp;own&nbsp;borders.&nbsp;New&nbsp;Generations,&nbsp;often&nbsp;called&nbsp;Youth&nbsp;Service,&nbsp;develops&nbsp;leadership&nbsp;among&nbsp;young&nbsp;people&nbsp;through&nbsp;programs&nbsp;such&nbsp;as&nbsp;Interact&nbsp;for&nbsp;secondary&nbsp;school&nbsp;students,&nbsp;Rotaract&nbsp;for&nbsp;young&nbsp;professionals,&nbsp;and&nbsp;Rotary&nbsp;Youth&nbsp;Exchange.&nbsp;Through&nbsp;The&nbsp;Rotary&nbsp;Foundation,&nbsp;clubs&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;district&nbsp;can&nbsp;apply&nbsp;for&nbsp;district&nbsp;and&nbsp;global&nbsp;grants&nbsp;across&nbsp;Rotary&#39;s&nbsp;seven&nbsp;areas&nbsp;of&nbsp;focus:&nbsp;disease&nbsp;prevention&nbsp;and&nbsp;treatment,&nbsp;water,&nbsp;sanitation,&nbsp;and&nbsp;hygiene,&nbsp;maternal&nbsp;and&nbsp;child&nbsp;health,&nbsp;basic&nbsp;education&nbsp;and&nbsp;literacy,&nbsp;community&nbsp;economic&nbsp;development,&nbsp;peacebuilding&nbsp;and&nbsp;conflict&nbsp;prevention,&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;environment.&nbsp;Guided&nbsp;by&nbsp;Rotary&#39;s&nbsp;motto&nbsp;of&nbsp;Service&nbsp;Above&nbsp;Self,&nbsp;District&nbsp;3141&nbsp;combines&nbsp;these&nbsp;local&nbsp;projects&nbsp;with&nbsp;Rotary&#39;s&nbsp;larger&nbsp;worldwide&nbsp;network&nbsp;of&nbsp;giving,&nbsp;fellowship,&nbsp;and&nbsp;volunteer&nbsp;service.</p>"}}}